### Phase 3 — ZCA (Interfaces, Utilities, Adapters, Events & Subscribers)
### Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start server first: .\run.bat

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Health Check (shows wired ZCA Utilities: EmployeeService & AuditLogUtility)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-health
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Employees (uses IEmployeeService Utility + IEmployeeSerializer Adapter summary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Single Employee (uses IEmployeeSerializer Adapter full view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-employees/EMP-0001
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Employee -> fires IEmployeeCreatedEvent -> Subscriber logs to AuditLogUtility!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api-employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0005",
  "nameEn": "Ren Kobayashi",
  "nameJa": "小林 蓮",
  "departmentEn": "Engineering",
  "departmentJa": "開発部",
  "role": "Platform Engineer",
  "email": "r.kobayashi@example.co.jp",
  "skills": ["Python", "ZCA", "MySQL"]
}

### 5. Check Audit Logs -> verify EMPLOYEE_CREATED event was captured automatically!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-audit-logs
Accept: application/json

### 6. Soft Delete Employee -> fires IEmployeeDeletedEvent -> Subscriber logs it!
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0005
Accept: application/json

### 7. Check Audit Logs again -> see both EMPLOYEE_DELETED and EMPLOYEE_CREATED!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-audit-logs
Accept: application/json

### 8. Validation Error (400 E_VALIDATION from EmployeeService)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api-employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0006"
}
